__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"TERMS_OF_USE_TEXT",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return o}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"PRIVACY_POLICY_TEXT",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return n}});const o="> DRAFT \u2014 NOT LEGAL ADVICE. This is a plain-language draft prepared for internal review. It must be reviewed by a qualified lawyer before any public launch or before real user sign-ups are enabled.\n\n# Podmienky pou\u017e\xedvania \u2014 Fazo\n\n## 1. O aplik\xe1cii\nFazo je aplik\xe1cia na spr\xe1vu osobn\xe9ho \u0161atn\xedka a AI n\xe1vrhy outfitov. Pou\u017e\xedvan\xedm aplik\xe1cie s\xfahlas\xedte s t\xfdmito podmienkami.\n\n## 2. F\xe1za spustenia\nFazo je moment\xe1lne v s\xfakromnej testovacej f\xe1ze na pozv\xe1nky \u2014 mal\xfd po\u010det pou\u017e\xedvate\u013eov, aplik\xe1cia sa akt\xedvne vyv\xedja. M\xf4\u017eu sa vyskytn\xfa\u0165 chyby alebo do\u010dasn\xe1 nedostupnos\u0165; funkcie sa m\xf4\u017eu meni\u0165.\n\n## 3. V\xe1\u0161 \xfa\u010det\n\xda\u010det si vytv\xe1rate cez e-mail a heslo; e-mailov\xfa adresu je potrebn\xe9 potvrdi\u0165. Ste zodpovedn\xed za bezpe\u010dnos\u0165 svojho hesla. \xda\u010det je ur\u010den\xfd na osobn\xe9, nekomer\u010dn\xe9 pou\u017eitie.\n\n## 4. V\xe1\u0161 obsah\nFotografie a inform\xe1cie, ktor\xe9 nahr\xe1te, zost\xe1vaj\xfa va\u0161e. D\xe1vate n\xe1m obmedzen\xe9 povolenie tento obsah spracova\u0165, aby aplik\xe1cia mohla fungova\u0165 (ulo\u017eenie, zobrazenie, AI popis/\xfaprava fotky, n\xe1vrh outfitov).\nZdie\u013eanie na n\xe1stenku je dobrovo\u013en\xe9: ak outfit zdie\u013ea\u0161, jeho vystrihnut\xe9 obr\xe1zky oble\u010denia, n\xe1zov a tvoje zobrazovan\xe9 meno uvidia v\u0161etci pou\u017e\xedvatelia. \u017diadna fotka osoby sa nezdie\u013ea. Zdie\u013ean\xe1 verzia je zmrazen\xe1 a m\xf4\u017ee\u0161 ju kedyko\u013evek odstr\xe1ni\u0165 (Profil \u2192 Tvoje zdie\u013ean\xe9 outfity). Nezdie\u013eaj nez\xe1konn\xfd, nen\xe1vistn\xfd \u010di sexu\xe1lne explicitn\xfd obsah ani obsah zobrazuj\xfaci in\xfa osobu bez jej s\xfahlasu; pr\xedspevky mo\u017eno nahl\xe1si\u0165 a prev\xe1dzkovate\u013e ich m\xf4\u017ee odstr\xe1ni\u0165.\n\n## 5. AI n\xe1vrhy\nN\xe1vrhy outfitov generuje umel\xe1 inteligencia. S\xfa to n\xe1vrhy, nie z\xe1ruka \u2014 nenahr\xe1dzaj\xfa v\xe1\u0161 vlastn\xfd \xfasudok.\n\n## 6. Affiliate odkazy\nAplik\xe1cia m\xf4\u017ee zobrazova\u0165 odkazy \"kde k\xfapi\u0165\" na tretie strany. Fazo m\xf4\u017ee z n\xe1kupu cez tak\xfdto odkaz z\xedska\u0165 prov\xedziu \u2014 to neovplyv\u0148uje cenu, ktor\xfa plat\xedte.\n\n## 7. Zru\u0161enie \xfa\u010dtu\n\xda\u010det aj v\u0161etky svoje d\xe1ta m\xf4\u017ee\u0161 kedyko\u013evek natrvalo vymaza\u0165 priamo v aplik\xe1cii (Profil \u2192 \xda\u010det \u2192 Vymaza\u0165 \xfa\u010det). Ak by samoobslu\u017en\xe9 vymazanie zlyhalo, nap\xed\u0161 n\xe1m na martinorolin12@gmail.com a dokon\u010d\xedme to za teba.\n\n## 8. Obmedzenie zodpovednosti\nFazo poskytujeme \"tak ako je\", bez z\xe1ruky konkr\xe9tneho v\xfdsledku.\n\n---\n\n# Terms of Use \u2014 Fazo (English)\n\n## 1. About the app\nFazo is a personal wardrobe management and AI outfit-suggestion app. By using the app, you agree to these terms.\n\n## 2. Launch phase\nFazo is currently in a private, invite-only test phase \u2014 actively under development. Bugs or temporary unavailability may occur; features may change.\n\n## 3. Your account\nYou create an account with email and password; the email must be verified. You are responsible for keeping your password secure. Personal, non-commercial use only.\n\n## 4. Your content\nPhotos and information you upload remain yours. You grant a limited permission to process this content so the app can work (storage, display, AI photo description/editing, outfit suggestions).\nSharing to the board is optional: if you share an outfit, its garment cut-out images, its title and your display name become visible to everyone using the app. No photo of a person is shared. A shared version is frozen, and you can remove it at any time (Profile \u2192 Your shared outfits). Do not share unlawful, hateful or sexually explicit content, or content showing another person without their consent; posts can be reported and the operator may remove them.\n\n## 5. AI suggestions\nOutfit suggestions are generated by AI. They are suggestions, not guarantees \u2014 they do not replace your own judgment.\n\n## 6. Affiliate links\nThe app may show \"where to buy\" links to third parties. Fazo may earn a commission from a purchase made via such a link \u2014 this does not affect the price you pay.\n\n## 7. Ending your account\nYou can permanently delete your account and all your data at any time, directly in the app (Profile \u2192 Account \u2192 Delete account). If self-service deletion ever fails, email us at martinorolin12@gmail.com and we'll finish it for you.\n\n## 8. Limitation of liability\nWe provide Fazo \"as is,\" without a guarantee of any specific outcome.\n\nFull draft: docs/legal/terms-of-use.md.",n="> DRAFT \u2014 NOT LEGAL ADVICE. This is a plain-language draft prepared for internal review. It must be reviewed by a qualified lawyer before any public launch or before real user sign-ups are enabled.\n\n# Z\xe1sady ochrany osobn\xfdch \xfadajov \u2014 Fazo\n\n## 1. Kto sme\nFazo je osobn\xe1 aplik\xe1cia na spr\xe1vu \u0161atn\xedka a n\xe1vrhy outfitov.\n\n## 2. Ak\xe9 \xfadaje zbierame\nPrihlasovacie \xfadaje (email, heslo \u2014 hashovan\xe9), fotografie oble\u010denia, inform\xe1cie o k\xfaskoch, hist\xf3riu nosenia a outfitov, \u0161t\xfdlov\xe9 preferencie, domovsk\xe9 mesto/polohu, technick\xe9 z\xe1znamy o pou\u017e\xedvan\xed AI funkci\xed.\n\n## 3. Pre\u010do tieto \xfadaje sprac\xfavame\nAby aplik\xe1cia fungovala, aby v\xe1m mohla navrhova\u0165 outfity, na \u0161tatistiky ako \"cena za nosenie\", a na prev\xe1dzku/ochranu slu\u017eby. Nepou\u017e\xedvame va\u0161e \xfadaje na reklamn\xe9 profilovanie ani ich nepred\xe1vame.\n\n## 4. Ako AI sprac\xfava va\u0161e fotky a \xfadaje\nAnthropic (Claude) popisuje fotky a generuje n\xe1vrhy outfitov; Replicate odstra\u0148uje pozadie z fotiek. Obe firmy s\xeddlia v USA \u2014 ide o prenos \xfadajov mimo EHP, ktor\xfd je potrebn\xe9 pred verejn\xfdm spusten\xedm pr\xe1vne overi\u0165.\n\n## 5. Po\u010dasie a poloha\nPribli\u017en\xe1 poloha alebo domovsk\xe9 mesto sa posiela slu\u017ebe Open-Meteo na \xfa\u010dely predpovede po\u010dasia.\n\n## 6. Kde sa va\u0161e d\xe1ta ukladaj\xfa\nSupabase, d\xe1tov\xe9 centrum v E\xda (Frankfurt). Fotografie s\xfa v s\xfakromn\xfdch \xfalo\u017eisk\xe1ch; row-level security zabezpe\u010duje, \u017ee v\xe1\u0161 \xfa\u010det vid\xed iba svoje d\xe1ta.\n\n## 6a. Zdie\u013eanie s in\xfdmi pou\u017e\xedvate\u013emi (n\xe1stenka)\nAk zdie\u013ea\u0161 outfit na n\xe1stenku, jeho vystrihnut\xe9 obr\xe1zky oble\u010denia, n\xe1zov a tvoje zobrazovan\xe9 meno uvidia v\u0161etci pou\u017e\xedvatelia. Deje sa to iba po tvojom v\xfdslovnom potvrden\xed \u2014 v\u0161etko je predvolene s\xfakromn\xe9. Obr\xe1zky sa kop\xedruj\xfa do samostatn\xe9ho verejn\xe9ho \xfalo\u017eiska; s\xfakromn\xe9 \xfalo\u017eisk\xe1 sa neotv\xe1raj\xfa. Zdie\u013eanie m\xf4\u017ee\u0161 zru\u0161i\u0165 a k\xf3pie sa vyma\u017e\xfa; vymazanie \xfa\u010dtu ich vyma\u017ee tie\u017e. Z profilu sa nezdie\u013eaj\xfa \u017eiadne \u0161t\xfdlov\xe9 preferencie, poloha ani \xfadaje o postave, tv\xe1ri \u010di vlasoch.\n\n## 7. Va\u0161e pr\xe1va (GDPR)\nPr\xedstup, export (Profil \u2192 Z\xe1lohova\u0165 d\xe1ta), vymazanie a oprava va\u0161ich \xfadajov. \xda\u010det aj svoje d\xe1ta m\xf4\u017ee\u0161 natrvalo vymaza\u0165 priamo v aplik\xe1cii (Profil \u2192 \xda\u010det \u2192 Vymaza\u0165 \xfa\u010det); ak by to zlyhalo, nap\xed\u0161 na martinorolin12@gmail.com.\n\n## 8. Deti\nFazo nie je ur\u010den\xfd de\u0165om mlad\u0161\xedm ako 16 rokov.\n\n---\n\n# Privacy Policy \u2014 Fazo (English)\n\n## 1. Who we are\nFazo is a personal wardrobe and outfit-suggestion app.\n\n## 2. What data we collect\nLogin details (email, hashed password), clothing photos, item details, wear/outfit history, style preferences, home city/location, technical AI-usage records.\n\n## 3. Why we process this data\nTo make the app work, suggest outfits, compute stats you've asked for, and run/protect the service. We do not use your data for ad profiling and do not sell it.\n\n## 4. How AI processes your photos and data\nAnthropic (Claude) describes photos and generates outfit suggestions; Replicate removes photo backgrounds. Both are US-based \u2014 an EEA\u2192US transfer that needs a confirmed legal basis before public launch.\n\n## 5. Weather and location\nYour approximate location or home city is sent to Open-Meteo for weather forecasting.\n\n## 6. Where your data is stored\nSupabase, EU data center (Frankfurt). Photos are private; row-level security restricts your account to its own data only.\n\n## 6a. Sharing with other users (the board)\nIf you share an outfit to the board, its garment cut-out images, its title and your display name become visible to everyone using the app. This only happens after you explicitly confirm it \u2014 everything is private by default. The images are copied into a separate public store; your private storage is never opened up. You can unshare and the copies are deleted; deleting your account deletes them too. No style preferences, location, or body, face or hair information from your profile is shared.\n\n## 7. Your rights (GDPR)\nAccess, export (Profile \u2192 Back up my data), deletion, and correction. You can permanently delete your account and data directly in the app (Profile \u2192 Account \u2192 Delete account); if that ever fails, email martinorolin12@gmail.com.\n\n## 8. Children\nFazo is not intended for children under 16.\n\nFull draft: docs/legal/privacy-policy.md."},1923,[]);
